# Additional OpenWrt feeds.
#
# This file uses the native OpenWrt feeds.conf syntax. Entries are appended to
# feeds.conf.default before the builder indexes the configured feeds and
# registers only packages selected by this profile and their dependencies.
#
# Examples:
# src-git myfeed https://github.com/example/openwrt-feed.git
# src-git myfeed https://github.com/example/openwrt-feed.git^main
#
# Leave this file with comments only when no additional feeds are required.
